{
  "$description": "Design tokens of the Enistere Foundation interface itself (document 04 — Système de design UX UI, ENI-FOUNDATION-UX-012), W3C Design Tokens format. A token of document 04 that is also the parent of other tokens (brand.primary) is written 'default' inside its group. Not the tokens of the systems Foundation builds: those are governed by their own Design System contracts (A9).",
